{"content":"<h1>存档清理工具 — 完整流程（源码级验证版）</h1>

<p>通过代码追踪，清理功能有 <strong>4条独立路径</strong>，每条都经过源码验证。</p>

<h2>一、四条清理路径总览</h2>

<ac:structured-macro ac:name="plantuml">
<ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 存档清理 - 四条路径全景

|运营人员|
start
:存档清理需求;
fork
  :**路径B: Python直连SW**\nclean-archiver.py\n(storage-scheduler/tools/);
fork
  :**路径A: Python调AM**\nclean-area-archiver.py\n(archiver-manager/tools/);
fork
  :**路径C: union-dispatch**\ncleanupTask()\nworker.go:510;
end fork

|路径B: storage-worker|
:POST /v1/storage_worker/clean\nClean.go:30;
:CleanParamCheck;
if (this_aciid > 0?) then (no)
  :返回参数错误;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:CleanWorkerExec;
if (uid>0 && gid>0?) then (yes)
  :**CleanWithLock**\nClean.go:117;
  :NewUidLoadLock().Lock();
  if (IsArchive && !AllowCleanup?) then (yes)
    :拒绝: Archive不支持的清理;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
else (no)
  :CleanLibrary;
endif
:**CleanFolder**\nClean.go:193;

if (存储类型?) then (Ceph/S3)
  :RemoveS3Folders\n直接删除S3目录;
else (文件存储)
  if (是Archive?) then (yes)
    :**MoveToTrash**\n移到回收站;
  else (no)
  endif
  :收集清理路径:\n· 用户数据目录+备份\n· 游戏数据目录+备份\n· snapshot/out_link;
  :逐路径**RemoveFolder**;
  :**UpdateIndexState**\n→ UserIndexStateDeleted;
endif
:Python脚本更新DAL:\nstate = 48;

|路径A: archiver-manager|
:POST /v1/group/cleanup\nhandler.go:268;
:GroupCleanup\n→ QueryUserBasicInfo;
:gagrps.Load(archiveID);
:**ArchiverGroup.Cleanup()**\nbackup.go:1030;
:ZK锁: ss-op/{uid}\nbackup.go:1031;
:ExpireArchivedActive;
:cleanup(主+备)\nbackup.go:766;
fork
  :Master cleanup;
fork
  :Slave cleanup;
end fork
:**RequestCleanup**\nhelper.go:2370;
:POST /v1/archiver/cleanup;
:SyncRule{Cmd: SyncCmdClean}\n→ Replay();

|路径C: union archiver dispatch|
:POST /v1/uarchiver/cleanup\nhandler.go:245;
:UAM Cleanup;
:ZK双重锁:\n· union_flow/{uuid}\n· uss/{uuid}-{ugid};
if (游戏中?) then (yes)
  :拒绝 (2106);
  stop
else (no)
endif
:POST /v1/archive/expire\n(非GroupCleanup!);
:**ExpireArchive**\nhandler.go:505;
:ExpireArchivedActive\nExpireScanedActive;
note right: 仅标记状态\n不删除文件!

stop
@enduml]]></ac:plain-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>

